<p><strong>7. Security Architecture</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Row-Level Security</strong>: Users see only their org\'s data</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Column-Level Security</strong>: Sensitive fields redacted</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Encryption</strong>: AES-256 at rest, TLS in transit</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Audit Log</strong>: Every access and change logged</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Permissions</strong>: Granular role-based access control</p>
